        <li>F. Brinkmann et al., “A Cross-Evaluated Database of Measured and Simulated HRTFs Including 3D Head Meshes, Anthropometric Features, and Headphone Impulse Responses”, <em>Journal of the Audio Engineering Society</em> 67(9), 2019. <a href="https://doi.org/10.17743/jaes.2019.0024">doi</a></li>
        <li>R. Sridhar, J. G. Tylka and E. Choueiri, “A Database of Head-Related Transfer Functions and Morphological Measurements”, AES 143rd Convention, New York, 2017.</li>
        <li>C. Armstrong, L. Thresh, D. Murphy and G. Kearney, “A Perceptual Evaluation of Individual and Non-Individual HRTFs: A Case Study of the SADIE II Database”, <em>Applied Sciences</em> 8(11), 2018. <a href="https://doi.org/10.3390/app8112029">doi</a></li>
        <li>S. A. Ausili et al., “Sound Localization with Hearables in Transparency Mode”, <em>Audiology Research</em> 15(3), 2025. <a href="https://doi.org/10.3390/audiolres15030048">doi</a></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="fine">Everything the decoder builds on is credited on <a href={foundations}>foundations</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Page>

